# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Qiskit bosons"
msgstr "Instructions d'installation pour la dernière version de Qiskit bosons"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Instructions d'installation"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Instructions d'installation {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This page explains how to install the Python API. A C API is not available for this package yet.\n"
msgstr "Cette page explique comment installer l'API Python. Une API C n'est pas encore disponible pour ce package.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Prérequis {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. Use [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Commence par créer un environnement minimal contenant uniquement Python. Utilise des [environnements virtuels Python](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Active ton nouvel environnement.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two primary ways to install this package: from PyPI or from source. The preferred method is to install from PyPI:\n"
msgstr "Il existe deux façons principales d'installer ce package : depuis PyPI ou depuis les sources. La méthode recommandée est d'installer depuis PyPI :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Installer depuis PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from source {#install-from-source}"
msgstr "Installer depuis les sources {#install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you plan to develop in the repository you should install from source.\n"
msgstr "Si tu prévois de développer dans le dépôt, tu devrais installer depuis les sources.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, Qiskit must be installed in the same Python environment that you install `qiskit-bosons` in. The simplest way to do this is from PyPI, but you can install Qiskit from source if you want to.\n"
msgstr "D'abord, Qiskit doit être installé dans le même environnement Python que celui où tu installes `qiskit-bosons`. Le plus simple est de l'installer depuis PyPI, mais tu peux installer Qiskit depuis les sources si tu le souhaites.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, clone the `qiskit-bosons` repository.\n"
msgstr "Ensuite, clone le dépôt `qiskit-bosons`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now, install the Rust toolchain, upgrade pip, and enter the repository. Refer to the [Rust documentation](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) for instructions on installing the toolchain.\n"
msgstr "Maintenant, installe la chaîne d'outils Rust, mets à jour pip et place-toi dans le dépôt. Consulte la [documentation de Rust](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) pour les instructions d'installation de la chaîne d'outils.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the remaining `build` dependencies. If you plan on developing in the repository, install the `dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "Installe les dépendances `build` restantes. Si tu prévois de développer dans le dépôt, installe les dépendances `dev`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-bosons` to the virtual environment.\n"
msgstr "L'étape suivante consiste à installer `qiskit-bosons` dans l'environnement virtuel.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Hint\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Astuce\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  You can also perform an editable install while still compiling the underlying Rust crate in `release` mode:\n"
msgstr "  Tu peux aussi faire une installation éditable tout en compilant la crate Rust sous-jacente en mode `release` :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Some features rely on optional dependencies. To install all of them, use the `all` extra:\n"
msgstr "  Certaines fonctionnalités reposent sur des dépendances optionnelles. Pour les installer toutes, utilise l'extra `all` :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Refer to the `[project.optional-dependencies]` section of [pyproject.toml](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-bosons/blob/main/pyproject.toml) to see which dependency groups are available.\n"
msgstr "  Consulte la section `[project.optional-dependencies]` de [pyproject.toml](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-bosons/blob/main/pyproject.toml) pour voir quels groupes de dépendances sont disponibles.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can optionally verify that the installation was successful. The simplest test is to try and import one of the classes provided by the `qiskit-bosons` package, as in the following example:\n"
msgstr "Tu peux éventuellement vérifier que l'installation a réussi. Le test le plus simple consiste à essayer d'importer l'une des classes fournies par le package `qiskit-bosons`, comme dans l'exemple suivant :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If this completes successfully, your installation worked.\n"
msgstr "Si cela se termine sans erreur, ton installation a fonctionné.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  You can also run the entire Python test suite:\n"
msgstr "  Tu peux aussi exécuter toute la suite de tests Python :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  To additionally run the tests that exercise optional dependencies, install the extras and use the `testoptional` target:\n"
msgstr "  Pour exécuter en plus les tests qui exercent les dépendances optionnelles, installe les extras et utilise la cible `testoptional` :\n"
